WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:06.220 --> 00:00:07.200
there you go

00:00:07.520 --> 00:00:08.820
she's all ready captain

00:00:09.160 --> 00:00:10.040
thanks Billy

00:00:12.260 --> 00:00:14.000
(Thunder)

00:00:30.660 --> 00:00:31.780
no!

00:00:33.240 --> 00:00:33.740
no!

00:00:42.020 --> 00:00:42.520
Ah!

00:00:50.160 --> 00:00:53.440
Derry's not like any town I've ever been in before

00:00:54.180 --> 00:00:55.360
people die or disappear

00:00:55.560 --> 00:00:57.320
6 times a national average

00:00:57.320 --> 00:00:58.280
(sighs) and that's just grown ups

00:00:58.800 --> 00:01:00.000
kids are worse

00:01:01.640 --> 00:01:02.140
way

00:01:02.880 --> 00:01:03.520
way worse

00:01:07.020 --> 00:01:09.220
(eerie singing) We all float down here

00:01:11.980 --> 00:01:13.020
I saw something

00:01:13.940 --> 00:01:14.900
there was this

00:01:15.640 --> 00:01:16.140
clown

00:01:20.920 --> 00:01:22.040
yeah I saw him too

00:01:24.260 --> 00:01:24.760
look

00:01:25.960 --> 00:01:27.480
it's all connected by the sewers

00:01:27.480 --> 00:01:28.300
that's where it lives

00:01:35.140 --> 00:01:36.100
what happened

00:01:37.780 --> 00:01:38.460
Bill?

00:01:47.760 --> 00:01:48.560
turn it off!

00:02:04.260 --> 00:02:05.520
(breaths heavily)

00:02:05.920 --> 00:02:08.840
Bill if you'll come with me, you'll float too

00:02:09.620 --> 00:02:10.180
Georgie

00:02:10.260 --> 00:02:15.360
you'll float too, you'll float too, you'll float too! You'll float too!!

00:02:15.800 --> 00:02:16.300
(Gasps)

00:02:16.480 --> 00:02:17.660
(Scream)

